messages.text:
The sounds of gently crashing waves...
The smell of salt in the air...{be00}
And a battle with a Trainer{be00}
in the prime of youth!{be01}

I feel rejuvenated whenever I get the
chance to have a Pokémon battle with{be00}
someone younger than myself.{be01}
It's like I'm taking in that
person's youthfulness!
